  "selection_guidance": [
    "Always filter by Scenario, Year, and Month to scope financial queries to the correct period.",
    "Use 'Consol GL Group' for consolidated group results; use 'Consol GL Company' for entity-level results.",
    "For intercompany elimination analysis prefer 'Consol GL Elimination Reconciliation' with Elimination Type and Intercompany Category filters.",
    "FX Rate queries require Currency From, Currency To, and FX Rate Type dimensions.",
    "Use Period Type 'Current' for monthly flow and 'YTD' for year-to-date balances in GL cubes.",
    "Reconciliation and close-process questions should use 'Consol Reconciliation Check Group/Company' or 'Consol Period Control'.",
    "For forecast analysis specify Version (e.g. FINAL, WIP) in 'SLIM Forecast PnL'.",
    "Segment 1 through Segment 4 provide operational sub-entity breakdowns across most GL cubes.",
    "For financial statement questions, use finance_semantics to choose the matched cube and put the mapped line_item_dimension on ROWS."
  ],
